# NFR-PORT-004: files are platform-independent, so checkouts must not rewrite them.
# IFCX files (golden files above all) keep their exact bytes on every platform: no end-of-line
# conversion, but still diffed as text (do not mark them binary).
*.ifcx -text
# insta snapshots are compared byte for byte; keep LF on every checkout.
*.snap text eol=lf
